          "text": "በረው ወልድን ሳያይ እንዳይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሞት መንፈስ ቅዱስ ነግሮት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታሪክ ፤ በጥሊምስ የሚባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል ገናና ንጉሥ ነበረ ከገናን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነቱ የተነሣ ይህን ዓለም እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ሰም አቅልጦ እንደ ገል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀጥቅጦ ገዝቶታል ። የገሩን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉ ቋንቋ ያውቅ ነበር።ምን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀረኝ ብሎ ጠየቀ ብዙ ጥበብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብዙ ምሳሌ ያለባቸው አርባ ስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድስቱ መጻሕፍተ ብሉያት ቀር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተውሃል አሉት።በዚያ ወራት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእስራኤል ሠልጥኖባቸዋልና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸሐፍቱንም መጻሕፍቱንም ስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደዱልኝ ብሎ ላከ።አርባ ስድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቱን መጻሕፍተ ብሉያት ሰባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁለት ጸሐፍት አድርገው ሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደዱለት።ሁለቱ ከመንገድ ሙ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ቀርተዋል ለሰባው የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላካቸው አንድ አንድ ብላቴና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እያደረገ ለሁለት ለሁለት አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳንድ ድንኳን ሰጣቸው።ሠላሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አምስት ይሆናል ታናናሹን አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዳንድ ዳጋጉን ለሁለት ለሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለት የዕብራይስጡን በጽርዕ ቋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንቋ ጻፉ ብሎ ሰጣቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጽሐፈ ኢሳይያስ ለስምዖን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደረሰው።ሲጽፍ ናሁ ድንግል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትፀንስ ወትወልድ ወልደ ከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሚለው አንቀጽ ደረሰ ። ድንግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል በድንግልና ትፀንሳለች በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድንግልና ትወልዳለች ብዬ ብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽፍ ስንኳን የአሕዛብ ንጉሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የእስራኤልስ ንጉሥ ቢሆን ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀበለኛል ብሎ ወለት ትፀንስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ጻፈ።እንቅልፍ መጥቶ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በት ተኝቶ ቢነቃ ወለትን ፍ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቆ ድንግልን ጽፎ አገኘ።ድ",
